  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guyana Climate Resilient Water Infrastructure Improvement Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PROGRAMA DE RESILIENCIA CLIMTICA DE MEJORAMIENTO DE INFRAESTRUCTURA DE AGUA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la primera operacin de prstamo individual es mejorar la resiliencia climtica y la sostenibilidad operativa y financiera de la prestacin de servicios de agua potable de GWI. Los objetivos especficos de la primera operacin de prstamo individual son: (i) proporcionar un nuevo acceso a servicios de agua potable de calidad para satisfacer la creciente demanda en Diamond y las comunidades circundantes; (ii) reducir el agua no contabilizada y mejorar la cobertura medidora en East Bank Demerara (EBD); East Coast Demerara (ECD) y Cummings Lodge Water System, Georgetown; y (iii) Mejorar las capacidades de gestin comercial, operacional y financiero y la digitalizacin de GWI.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Objective of the first individual loan operation is to enhance the climate resilience, operational and financial sustainability of GWI&apos;s potable water services provision. The specific objectives of the first individual loan operation are to: (i) provide new access to quality potable water services to meet growing demand in Diamond and surrounding communities; (ii) reduce Non-Revenue Water and improve metered coverage in the East Bank Demerara (EBD), the East Coast of Demerara (ECD) and Cummings Lodge Water System, Georgetown; and (iii) Improve commercial, operational and financial management capabilities and digitalization of GWI.</narrative>
  </description>
